                        <h1 class="post-title">FTX Seeks Bankruptcy Court Approval to Sell $1.4 Billion Stake in AI Startup Anthropic</h1>

                                                    <div class="post-teaser">
                                <p><span style="font-weight: 400">The bankrupt crypto exchange could repay creditors and customers from the proceeds obtained by selling the 8% stake.</span></p>
                            </div>
                        
